# myUNO — Cursor AI Rules
# Project by Pavel Ignatev | Ignatev Group | Phuket, Thailand

## PROJECT IDENTITY
myUNO is a super-app platform consolidating Phuket services into one ecosystem.
It is part of a three-division flywheel:
- Ignatev Capital → brings investors
- Ignatev Estate → manages properties
- myUNO → serves residents of those assets, generates data and cashflow

Target users: Russian-speaking tourists, expats, property owners, investors in Phuket.
Current stage: Pre-PMF. 7 users, 0 transactions. Validation is the priority.

## TECH STACK
- Frontend: React + TypeScript + Vite
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Backend/DB: Supabase (PostgreSQL + Auth + Storage + Realtime) — managed by Lovable Cloud
- Hosting: Lovable (auto-deploy)
- Testing: Vitest + Playwright (e2e)
- Routing: React Router with APP_ROUTES constants (never hardcode route strings)

